<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_swleader1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『あまり
わだいに　なっていないけれど▼
カゴメタウンの　ちかくで
きになることが　あったんだよね▼
いっしゅん　とはいえ
マイナス５０ど　にもなる　すうちが▽
けいそく　されたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:39:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『あまり
話題に　なっていないけれど▼
カゴメタウンの　近くで
気になることが　あったんだよね▼
一瞬　とはいえ
－５０度　にもなる　数値が▽
計測されたんだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:39:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswleader1_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:08:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:53:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_swleader1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それだけじゃない▼
おなじような　すうちが
ヒウンシティと　ホドモエシティでも▽
けいそく　されてね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それだけじゃない▼
同じような　数値が
ヒウンシティと　ホドモエシティでも▽
計測されてね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:53:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswleader1_03
※演出未定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:09:54" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:53:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_swleader1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>で　さきほどの　プラズマだんの
いっけんが　あったでしょ？▼
これは　しらべておかないと
まずい　きが　するんだ▼
……さむいのは
にがて　なんだけどな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:06:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>で　さきほどの　プラズマ団の
一件が　あったでしょ？▼
これは　調べておかないと
まずい　気が　するんだ▼
……寒いのは
苦手なんだけどな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:06:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswleader1_04
※演出未定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:09:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:53:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_swleader1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>で　きみに　これを　わたすから
いろんなところを　しらべて　みてよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:06:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>で　きみに　これを　渡すから
いろんな所を　調べてみてよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:06:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:52:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手処理
　No422「ひでんマシン０３」
・続けてswleader1_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T04:04:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:53:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_swleader1_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あしどめ　して　わるかったね▼
ただ　なにか
おかしなことが　あるかも　しれない▼
きをつけて　たびを　つづけてね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:08:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:08:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>足止めして　悪かったね▼
ただ　なにか
おかしなことが　あるかも　しれない▼
気をつけて　旅を　続けてね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T04:04:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:08:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・c08到着まで繰り返し
・c08到着で削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:11:46" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:08:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_assistantm1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こちら　きせつけんきゅうじょ　です▼
フキヨセのさき　ネジやま　では
きせつによって　ゆきがつもりますよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:12:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こちら　季節研究所　です▼
フキヨセの先　ネジ山では
季節によって　雪が積もりますよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:13:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTM
助手♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_assistantm2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きせつの　えいきょうで
がいけんが　かわる　ポケモン……▼
これも　しんかの　いっしゅと
いえるのでしょうか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:13:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>季節の　影響で
外見が　変わる　ポケモン……▼
これも　進化の　一種と
いえるのでしょうか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-07T03:13:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTM
助手♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_assistantm4_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>４つの　きせつの　シキジカが
どうじに　みられる　けんきゅうじょ！▼
シキジカについてなら
ちょっとした　エキスパート　です▼
どうですか？　われわれが　みつけた
ちょっと　めずらしい　シキジカを▽
あなたも　そだててみませんか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T12:14:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:04:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>４つの　季節の　シキジカが
同時に　みられる　研究所！▼
シキジカについてなら
ちょっとした　エキスパート　です▼
どうですか？　われわれが　みつけた
ちょっと　珍しい　シキジカを▽
あなたも　育ててみませんか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T12:15:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:22:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ポケモン入手前
・はい/いいえ
　はい
　はい、でも手持ち一杯
　いいえ
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:10:46" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTM
助手♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:02:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_assistantm4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はい！
かわいがって　あげてください！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:19:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:19:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はい！
かわいがって　あげてください！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T10:22:44" />
