	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あらあら　あなたの　[Name:PokemonName ]
「[Name:Move Idx="1" ]」を　おぼえていますね！▼
そんな　あなたに
ポケモン　てんきよほう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:24:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あらあら　あなたの　[Name:PokemonName ]
「[Name:Move Idx="1" ]」を　覚えていますね！▼
そんな　あなたに
ポケモン　天気予報！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T04:06:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:37:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・0＝ポケモン種族名
・1＝わざ名
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:24:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:08:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あらあら　めずらしい！
あなたの　[Name:PokemonName ]▼
「[Name:Ability Idx="2" ]」の　とくせいを
おもち　なのですね！▼
そんな　あなたに
ポケモン　てんきよほう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:25:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あらあら　珍しい！
あなたの　[Name:PokemonName ]▼
「[Name:Ability Idx="2" ]」の　特性を
お持ち　なのですね！▼
そんな　あなたに
ポケモン　天気予報！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T04:05:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:37:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・0＝ポケモン種族名
・2＝とくせい名
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:25:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_ame_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゴホン……！▼
「あまごい」の　わざを　つかったり
「あめふらし」の　とくせいを　もつ▼
ポケモンを　くりだすことで
あめが　ふりはじめるでしょう</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:25:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:15:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゴホン……！▼
「あまごい」の　技を　使ったり
「あめふらし」の　特性を　持つ▼
ポケモンを　繰りだすことで
雨が　降りはじめるでしょう</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T06:22:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:37:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#008000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_ame_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あめが　ふりつづいている　ときは
みずタイプの　わざの　いりょくが▽
５０パーセント　アップするでしょう！▼
そして　ほのおタイプの　わざと
ソーラービームの　いりょくは▽
５０パーセント　ダウンします！▼
さらに　ウェザーボールの　タイプが
みずに　かわり　いりょくは▽
１００パーセント　アップするでしょう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:26:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:15:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>雨が　降り続いている　ときは
みずタイプの　技の　威力が▽
５０パーセント　アップするでしょう！▼
そして　ほのおタイプの　技と
ソーラービームの　威力は▽
５０パーセント　ダウンします！▼
さらに　ウェザーボールの　タイプが
みずに　変わり　威力は▽
１００パーセント　アップするでしょう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T04:02:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:28:57" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#008000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_ame_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なお　ポワルンという　ポケモンは
あめが　ふりつづいていると▽
すがたが　かわり▽
みずタイプに　なることでも▽
しられて　おります</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T04:06:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:15:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なお　ポワルンという　ポケモンは
雨が　降り続いていると▽
姿が　変わり▽
みずタイプに　なることでも▽
知られて　おります</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T04:04:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:37:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#008000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_ame_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そらが　よどみますので
あさのひざし　こうごうせい▽
つきのひかり　で　たいりょくが▽
かいふくする　りょうが▽
すくなく　なります！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:27:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:15:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>空が　よどみますので
あさのひざし　こうごうせい▽
つきのひかり　で　体力が▽
回復する　量が▽
少なく　なります！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T04:06:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:37:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#008000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r06r0101_ambrella_ame_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つづいて　ちゅういほうです！▼
かみなり　と　ぼうふう　が
かならず　めいちゅう　しますので▽
おきを　つけください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T12:18:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:15:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>続いて　注意報です！▼
かみなり　と　ぼうふう　が
必ず　命中しますので▽
お気を　つけください！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T12:18:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:37:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>AMBRELLA</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T09:12:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#008000</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
